  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alternative Learning and Empowerment Pathways for Afghan Women (ALEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the &quot;Alternative Learning and Empowerment Pathways for Afghan Women (ALEP)&quot; programme is to safeguard the educational and professional futures of Afghan girls and women by scaling up proven models of accredited alternative education and integrating them with tangible economic empowerment, thereby mitigating the devastating impact of the bans, contributing to the preservation of the country&apos;s women intellectual capital, and providing a foundation for individual and community resilience, thereby reducing poverty and empowering the most marginalized.</narrative>
  </description>
